OL,3,AStorm Boelo amber warnings kick in as
OL,4,Aparts of UK brace for 80mph gusts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmber weather warnings have come into
OL,7,Fforce in northern parts of the UK as
OL,8,FStorm Boelo continues to move across
OL,9,Fthe country, with wind gusts up to
OL,10,F80mph forecast in the worst-hit areas.
OL,12,FStrong winds and heavy showers will
OL,13,Fintensify through Saturday night, with
OL,14,Fwidespread gusts expected to hit
OL,15,FScotland, Northern Ireland and northern
OL,16,FEngland.
OL,18,FThe amber warning for Scotland and
OL,19,FEngland will stay in place until 21:00
OL,20,Fon Sunday, bringing an increased risk
OL,21,Fof travel disruption and potential risk
OL,22,Fto life.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
